802.1S Multi Instance STP

@Core taas/Baba step1: Create VTP (VLAN trunking Protocol)
conf t
vtp domain ccna
vtp password pass
vtp mode server
vtp version 2
end



Step2: Organize VLAN
@Core Taas
Conf t
vlan 11-19
exit
vlan 21-29
exit
vlan 31-39
end

@Baba
enable MSTP

conf t
spanning-tree mode mst
spanning-tree mst configuration
name supermanstp
revision 1
instance 1 vlan 11-19
instance 2 vlan 21-29
instance 3 vlan 31-39
end
sh spanning-tree mst configuration


reset the primary secondary roles
@for rootbridge
Conf t
spanning-tree mst 0 root primary
spanning-tree mst 1 root secondary
spanning-tree mst 2 root primary
spanning-tree mst 3 root secondary
end

@for non root
Conf t
spanning-tree mst 0 root Secondary
spanning-tree mst 1 root primary
spanning-tree mst 2 root Secondary
spanning-tree mst 3 root primary

